  "claim": "The byte printed `Dly Fb` closes a loop around the delay, on the one type whose delay was read clear of the rest of its chain: 04 00's copy of the note at 300.0 ms is read at every setting, and a second copy at twice that stands among the three strongest features of every take at 95 and 127 and of none at 0, 32 or 34. How much of the return goes round is not something this stage reads at any setting -- it places a copy and does not weigh one -- and on the other two types walked at five settings the delay was not among the three strongest features of any take, so no law in the byte is set for feedback and none is carried to another type.",
